{"4149960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Feed", "steam_appid": 4149960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149960/extras/5f2cbedd7d5c1aa9094cbafec3586b69.avif?t=1764320242\" width=600 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEAD FEED</strong> is a psychological, ghost-hunting horror game that follows two friends, <strong>Ethan</strong> and <strong>Sam</strong>, as they embark on a late-night investigation inside an abandoned, haunted house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethan takes on the role of the main investigator, venturing deep into the darkness to set up cameras and uncover the truth behind the paranormal activity. Meanwhile, Sam stays behind, monitoring every feed and sound from his laptop, safe behind the screen… or so he thinks.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149960/extras/fb3122110cf5f3b34d68c69ecefaeaac.avif?t=1764320242\" width=600 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll <strong>alternate between both characters</strong>, seeing the story unfold from two unique perspectives — one trapped inside the terror, the other slowly realizing that something sinister is watching through the cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a fun ghost hunt quickly descends into a <strong>psychological nightmare</strong>, blurring the line between what’s real and what’s imagined.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149960/extras/bf1e3406de333b741ab3d94130e28a5f.poster.avif?t=1764320242\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149960/extras/bf1e3406de333b741ab3d94130e28a5f.webm?t=1764320242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149960/extras/bf1e3406de333b741ab3d94130e28a5f.mp4?t=1764320242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: 40 - 50 minutes only</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two connected perspectives — play as both the hunter and the observer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive environmental storytelling that rewards keen observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric tension and psychological horror over cheap jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality 3D surround sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual dread buildup and psychological tension</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149960/extras/5f2cbedd7d5c1aa9094cbafec3586b69.avif?t=1764320242\" width=600 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEAD FEED</strong> is a psychological, ghost-hunting horror game that follows two friends, <strong>Ethan</strong> and <strong>Sam</strong>, as they embark on a late-night investigation inside an abandoned, haunted house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethan takes on the role of the main investigator, venturing deep into the darkness to set up cameras and uncover the truth behind the paranormal activity. Meanwhile, Sam stays behind, monitoring every feed and sound from his laptop, safe behind the screen… or so he thinks.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149960/extras/fb3122110cf5f3b34d68c69ecefaeaac.avif?t=1764320242\" width=600 hei